The updates of $\mathbb{E}\left[z_{i,t}^{(k)}|\mathcal{F}_k\right]$ can be viewed as a noiseless case (i.e., $\sigma_{g,2} =\sigma_f = 0$) of Lemma \ref{lem: dsgd_quadratic}. Using this observation, \eqref{ineq: quadratic_conv}, and the definition of $\|c\|$ and $\tilde{M}$, we know \eqref{ineq: z_exp_cons} holds.

