\label{ineq: stepsize_for_higp}
    Let $M$ be the matrix defined in Lemma \ref{lem: dsgd_quadratic}. There exist $0<\alpha_1<\alpha_2$ such that $\alpha\in (\alpha_1, \alpha_2)$ and
